    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game has 50 levels including extra large maps, in an arcade maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter terrain using bombs, Hunt all monsters and uncover the green brick to proceed to next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain Buffs and boosts to up the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634920/extras/44ed75c09d83d30710523db2df4fc95a.poster.avif?t=1755149108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634920/extras/44ed75c09d83d30710523db2df4fc95a.webm?t=1755149108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634920/extras/44ed75c09d83d30710523db2df4fc95a.mp4?t=1755149108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game has 50 levels including extra large maps, in an arcade maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter terrain using bombs, Hunt all monsters and uncover the green brick to proceed to next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain Buffs and boosts to up the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634920/extras/44ed75c09d83d30710523db2df4fc95a.poster.avif?t=1755149108\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634920/extras/44ed75c09d83d30710523db2df4fc95a.webm?t=1755149108\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634920/extras/44ed75c09d83d30710523db2df4fc95a.mp4?t=1755149108\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
